<main>
<section class="project-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">SPATIAL INVESTMENT LAB / ASHEVILLE, NORTH CAROLINA</p><h1>Where should an incentive<br />budget go?</h1></div><p class="project-question">Regional growth depends on what is additional.<br />Local opportunity also depends on where it lands.</p></section>
<div class="experiment-strip"><span class="status-dot"></span><strong>POLICY SCENARIO</strong><span>Observed economic geography · explicit behavioral assumptions</span><span class="scenario-tag" id="scenario-tag">Preparing the model</span></div>
<section class="workspace" aria-label="Spatial investment policy model">
<div class="map-column"><div class="map-wrap">
<div id="economic-map" aria-label="Interactive 3D terrain, employment columns and investment clusters"></div>
<div class="map-caption"><span>ASHEVILLE, NC</span><span>35.59° N / 82.56° W</span></div>
<div class="map-tools"><button id="reset-camera" type="button">Reset view</button><button id="top-view" type="button">Overhead</button></div>
<div class="map-legend"><strong id="map-layer-label">Existing employment</strong><span id="height-legend">Column height = 2023 primary jobs</span><div><i class="loss-gradient"></i><span id="color-legend">Teal: baseline · gold: investment cluster</span></div><span>1 km cells · six hypothetical location choices</span></div>
<p id="map-status" class="map-status" role="status">Connecting 3D terrain…</p>
</div>
<div class="map-mode"><span>Map layer</span><button type="button" data-layer="employment" aria-pressed="true">Employment</button><button type="button" data-layer="access" aria-pressed="false">Access change</button><button type="button" data-layer="allocation" aria-pressed="false">Budget allocation</button></div>
<div class="metrics" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
<div><span>Additional study-area jobs</span><strong id="net-jobs">…</strong><small id="growth-share">Conditional on assumptions</small></div>
<div><span>Cost / additional job-year</span><strong id="job-year-cost">…</strong><small>Discounted · dollars, not fiscal return</small></div>
<div><span>Lower-earnings access gain</span><strong id="access-gain">…</strong><small>Gravity-weighted job opportunities</small></div>
</div>
<div class="selection" id="selection" aria-live="polite"><strong>Inspect a location</strong><span>Select a column or cluster to inspect employment and the policy’s local effect.</span></div>
</div>
<aside id="scenario" class="scenario-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span class="eyebrow">01 / INCENTIVE DESIGN</span><h2>Separate offers from growth.</h2><p>All policy values below are scenario assumptions.</p></div>
{controls.map(c=><div class="parameter"><label for={c.id}>{c.label}<output id={`${c.id}-value`}>{c.display}</output></label><input id={c.id} type="range" min={c.min} max={c.max} step={c.step} value={c.value}/>{c.help&&<small>{c.help}</small>}</div>)}
